{"id":2658,"date":"2026-06-09T12:26:39","date_gmt":"2026-06-09T12:26:39","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2658"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:47:35","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:47:35","slug":"kota-magenta-red-cotton-finish-stone","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/kota-magenta-red-cotton-finish-stone\/","title":{"rendered":"Magenta Red Cotton Finish Stone"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"339\" data-end=\"717\">Kota Magenta Red Cotton Finish is a premium natural sandstone from the Kota stone family, admired for its vibrant reddish-magenta tones and naturally textured surface. Its distinctive appearance brings warmth, elegance, and character to a wide range of architectural and landscaping applications, making it a popular choice among architects, designers, builders, and homeowners.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"1100\">The natural beauty of this stone complements both contemporary and traditional design styles, allowing it to blend seamlessly into residential, commercial, hospitality, and outdoor projects. Whether used for flooring, wall cladding, pathways, courtyards, garden areas, or feature walls, it creates a timeless and sophisticated look that enhances the overall aesthetic of any space.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1102\" data-end=\"1424\">Renowned for its durability and long-lasting performance, Kota Magenta Red Cotton Finish is capable of withstanding varying environmental conditions while maintaining its natural charm. Its textured finish and unique color variations provide an authentic stone appearance that cannot be replicated by artificial materials.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1426\" data-end=\"1789\">With its combination of strength, visual appeal, and versatility, this sandstone remains a preferred material for both interior and exterior applications. The rich natural color, premium finish, and enduring quality make Kota Magenta Red Cotton Finish an excellent c